     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRAttachmentLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRAttachmentLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRAttachmentLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-fr-lm-attachment.html\">Logical model - FR LM Attachment</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-document-attache.html\">CDA - FR Document attache</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADocumentAttache.component:frObservationMedia.observationMedia</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment.contentType</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADocumentAttache.component:frObservationMedia.observationMedia.value.mediaType</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment.language</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADocumentAttache.component:frObservationMedia.observationMedia.languageCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment.data</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADocumentAttache.component:frObservationMedia.observationMedia.value</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment.url</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDADocumentAttache.component:frObservationMedia.observationMedia.value.reference</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment.size</td><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun attribut CDA direct identifié pour la taille de la pièce jointe.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment.title</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\"/><td>Le titre du document attaché est mappé vers le texte de l'observation du type de document attaché.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-fr-lm-attachment.html\">Logical model - FR LM Attachment</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-fhir-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-document-reference-document.html\">DocumentReference - FR Document reference Document</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRDocumentReferenceDocument.content.attachment</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment.contentType</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRDocumentReferenceDocument.content.attachment.contentType</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment.language</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRDocumentReferenceDocument.content.attachment.language</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment.data</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRDocumentReferenceDocument.content.attachment.data</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment.url</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRDocumentReferenceDocument.content.attachment.url</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment.size</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRDocumentReferenceDocument.content.attachment.size</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttachment.title</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRDocumentReferenceDocument.content.attachment.title</td></tr></table></div>"
